    "text": "This is a greedy, event-driven list scheduler. It never moves services or creates binaries, which keeps the output valid by construction.\n\n**Model**\n- Each feature becomes a set of tasks, one per distinct binary that holds at least one of its services.\n- Each task is a pair (feature, binary) and is given to exactly one engineer. So two engineers can never implement the same feature in the same binary.\n- With no moves, no other rule in the statement can be broken.\n- Every task starts before the time limit and takes at least 2 days. So no engineer gets more than L tasks, and no `wait` is needed.\n\n**Simulation**\n- Features are processed in priority order, and a feature's tasks are queued in a row.\n- Within a feature, the longest task (largest binary) is started first.\n- Each free engineer takes the next task when they become free. Engineers free on the same day are handled in file order, as the statement's tie rule requires.\n- C_B is the number of implementation tasks still running on binary B at the start day. I assume a task that ends on day t no longer counts on day t. If the official checker counts it differently, only the score estimate changes, not validity.\n- A feature is skipped if it clearly cannot launch in time. It is dropped if one of its tasks would end at or after L.\n\n**Search**\n- Priorities have the form U / cost^a, where cost is the feature's total engineer-days.\n- Several exponents a are tried, and the schedule with the best simulated score is printed.\n- A time guard stops the search after about 7 seconds.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint L,G,S,B,F,N;\nvector<string> fname;\nvector<int> fD; vector<long long> fU;\nvector<vector<int>> fbins;\nvector<int> R;\n\nlong long simulate(const vector<int>& order, vector<vector<pair<int,int>>>& asg){\n    asg.assign(G, {});\n    priority_queue<pair<int,int>, vector<pair<int,int>>, greater<pair<int,int>>> pq;\n    for(int i=0;i<G;i++) pq.push({0,i});\n    vector<priority_queue<int,vector<int>,greater<int>>> bh(B);\n    vector<int> fend(F,0); vector<char> aband(F,0), complete(F,0);\n    size_t fi=0; size_t ti=0;\n    while(!pq.empty()){\n        auto [t,e]=pq.top(); pq.pop();\n        if(t>=L) continue;\n        int tf=-1,tb=-1;\n        while(fi<order.size()){\n            int f=order[fi];\n            if(aband[f]){fi++;ti=0;continue;}\n            if(ti>=fbins[f].size()){complete[f]=1;fi++;ti=0;continue;}\n            if(ti==0){\n                int mx=fD[f]+R[fbins[f][0]];\n                if(t+mx>=L){aband[f]=1;fi++;ti=0;continue;}\n            }\n            tf=f; tb=fbins[f][ti]; ti++;\n            break;\n        }\n        if(tf<0) continue;\n        auto &h=bh[tb];\n        while(!h.empty() && h.top()<=t) h.pop();\n        int C=h.size();\n        int dur=fD[tf]+R[tb]+C;\n        int en=t+dur;\n        if(en>=L){\n            aband[tf]=1; fi++; ti=0;\n            pq.push({t,e});\n            continue;\n        }\n        h.push(en);\n        asg[e].push_back({tf,tb});\n        fend[tf]=max(fend[tf],en);\n        pq.push({en,e});\n    }\n    // mark completion for current feature if all tasks assigned\n    if(fi<order.size()){\n        int f=order[fi];\n        if(!aband[f] && ti>=fbins[f].size()) complete[f]=1;\n    }\n    long long sc=0;\n    for(int f=0;f<F;f++) if(complete[f]&&!aband[f]&&fend[f]<L) sc+=fU[f]*(long long)(L-fend[f]);\n    return sc;\n}\n\nint main(){\n    auto st=chrono::steady_clock::now();\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);cin.tie(nullptr);\n    cin>>L>>G>>S>>B>>F>>N;\n    unordered_map<string,int> sb; sb.reserve(S*2+10);\n    R.assign(B,0);\n    for(int i=0;i<S;i++){string n;int b;cin>>n>>b;sb[n]=b;R[b]++;}\n    fname.resize(F);fD.resize(F);fU.resize(F);fbins.resize(F);\n    for(int i=0;i<F;i++){\n        int m;cin>>fname[i]>>m>>fD[i]>>fU[i];\n        vector<int> bs;\n        for(int j=0;j<m;j++){string s;cin>>s;bs.push_back(sb[s]);}\n        sort(bs.begin(),bs.end());bs.erase(unique(bs.begin(),bs.end()),bs.end());\n        sort(bs.begin(),bs.end(),[&](int a,int b){if(R[a]!=R[b])return R[a]>R[b];return a<b;});\n        fbins[i]=bs;\n    }\n    vector<double> cost(F);\n    for(int f=0;f<F;f++){double c=0;for(int b:fbins[f])c+=fD[f]+R[b];cost[f]=c;}\n    vector<double> exps={1.0,0.5,0.75,1.25,1.5,2.0,0.25,3.0};\n    long long best=-1; vector<vector<pair<int,int>>> bestAsg, asg;\n    for(double a:exps){\n        double el=chrono::duration<double>(chrono::steady_clock::now()-st).count();\n        if(el>7.0 && best>=0) break;\n        vector<int> order(F); iota(order.begin(),order.end(),0);\n        vector<double> key(F);\n        for(int f=0;f<F;f++) key[f]=(double)fU[f]/pow(cost[f],a);\n        stable_sort(order.begin(),order.end(),[&](int x,int y){return key[x]>key[y];});\n        long long sc=simulate(order,asg);\n        if(sc>best){best=sc;bestAsg.swap(asg);}\n    }\n    string out;\n    int E=0;\n    for(int i=0;i<G;i++) if(!bestAsg[i].empty()) E++;\n    out+=to_string(E)+\"\\n\";\n    for(int i=0;i<G;i++){\n        if(bestAsg[i].empty()) continue;\n        out+=to_string(bestAsg[i].size())+\"\\n\";\n        for(auto&p:bestAsg[i]){\n            out+=\"impl \"; out+=fname[p.first]; out+=\" \"; out+=to_string(p.second); out+=\"\\n\";\n        }\n    }\n    fwrite(out.data(),1,out.size(),stdout);\n}\n```",
